  "description": "“I’m pregnant. And it’s not your child—it’s another man’s.”     \nJaehyuk’s cold gaze swept over Soyun’s stomach.    \n\n“Didn’t you say you liked me? And yet, another man?”    \n“It was a misunderstanding.”    \n“What?”     \n“I mistook admiration for love. Longing for something I could never have…”    \n\nIn her childhood, Jaehyuk had seemed like a prince when she met him in a mansion as vast as a castle from a fairy tale. That first love became a long, painful unrequited one that tormented Soyun. Because Han Jaehyuk was a man she could never have.     \n\n“So let’s end it here. Our relationship.”     \n“……”     \n“Executive Director Han Jaehyuk.”     \n\nJust as Soyun was about to walk away from him, Jaehyuk shoved her against the wall.     \n\n“What are you doing?”     \n“It’s fine. I’ll overlook your reckless behavior—just this once. Of course, it’ll be the last.”     \n\nRight before their lips touched, Jaehyuk whispered low into Soyun’s ear.     \n“Don’t even dream of running away from me. For the rest of your life.”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13152084), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1434022468), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/inhousesecretary), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/jataek_biseo), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000075110)",
